                    {
                        "form_id": "13d86910-1ed3-4c84-aafc-d85b306e1748",
                        "entry_id": "cc1c2033-860e-387c-aff4-79f97eef4865",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "sisyphien"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "81bddcde-bdf5-3dcc-afe2-03f0eefdb373",
                        "entry_id": "cc1c2033-860e-387c-aff4-79f97eef4865",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qualifie une action sans fin."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4264822a-ad4b-4c35-8f62-f39412f677e8",
                                "sense_id": "81bddcde-bdf5-3dcc-afe2-03f0eefdb373",
                                "text": "Toutes les tentatives (…) s'épuisent en vaines querelles tant la tâche semble sisyphéenne et les moyens trop chiches."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3936faa4-3e58-44af-bcd4-3d8f405def53",
                                "sense_id": "81bddcde-bdf5-3dcc-afe2-03f0eefdb373",
                                "text": "Ils portent des vêtements de travail légers, de couleurs différentes selon les sections auxquelles ils appartiennent, mais uniformément blancs de plâtre car leur tâche commune est le déblaiement véritablement sisyphéen des ruines amoncelées là depuis la fin de la guerre."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "52332db2-738b-4292-b947-7a74f25e775e",
                                "sense_id": "81bddcde-bdf5-3dcc-afe2-03f0eefdb373",
                                "text": "Le consentement, récit finement ciselé, relate le trajet qui débute dans l'euphorie et se termine en un cauchemar sisyphéen."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5b1d458c-1b0b-4945-8864-20b824e47449",
                        "source_entry_id": "cc1c2033-860e-387c-aff4-79f97eef4865",
                        "source_sense_id": "81bddcde-bdf5-3dcc-afe2-03f0eefdb373",
                        "target_lang_word": "Sisyphean",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Sisyphean",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f4796b3-bb05-3411-a705-ecdcc820f77a",
                                        "entry_id": "d7cb3d42-b2d4-3f9c-9445-844bff07ecd7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Incessant or incessantly recurring, but futile."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e21f225e-612c-40b7-9646-80368356afb0",
                                                "sense_id": "8f4796b3-bb05-3411-a705-ecdcc820f77a",
                                                "text": "Sisyphean task"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2eddbee-1bbd-463c-9062-cadf8ffb66c8",
                                                "sense_id": "8f4796b3-bb05-3411-a705-ecdcc820f77a",
                                                "text": "Sisyphean labors"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d602f8b-22e4-43f0-9b3b-4a7e7699a753",
                                                "sense_id": "8f4796b3-bb05-3411-a705-ecdcc820f77a",
                                                "text": "Four bucketsful of water—one for each cell—seven for the long passage, two for lavatory and w.c.'s, brasses to clean, paint to dust. It seemed a Sisyphean task, no sooner ended than a new one was exacted."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be0c9199-8dfe-4319-9d31-5575b7161a1f",
                                                "sense_id": "8f4796b3-bb05-3411-a705-ecdcc820f77a",
                                                "text": "As the world's drug habit shows, governments are failing in their quest to monitor every London window-box and Andean hillside for banned plants. But even that Sisyphean task looks easy next to the fight against synthetic drugs. No sooner has a drug been blacklisted than chemists adjust their recipe and start churning out a subtly different one."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa12ad76-8df5-44e2-a9f7-3cd6129ddc30",
                                                "sense_id": "8f4796b3-bb05-3411-a705-ecdcc820f77a",
                                                "text": "Fact is, this appliance actually contains some heaters in addition to its coolers. That apparent self-defeating contradiction is not a Sisyphean exercise in futility devised as a cruel philosophical joke by nihilistic engineers. It's actually just one of several brilliant pieces of engineering that have made these ubiquitous boxes utterly transformative forces in our lives."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8864294-daec-485f-9024-0e78e7c4a02d",
                                                "sense_id": "8f4796b3-bb05-3411-a705-ecdcc820f77a",
                                                "text": "But whoever does the policing, whether a supervisor or an operator, faces a Sisyphean battle against a well-documented phenomenon: something called automation complacency. When you automate any part of a task, the human overseer starts to trust that the machine has it handled and stops paying attention."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f4993bf-7c30-49e7-96b6-e54413ae2b41",
                                                "sense_id": "8f4796b3-bb05-3411-a705-ecdcc820f77a",
                                                "text": "I wasn’t cursed to some joyless Sisyphean slog."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4050d722-8978-32d5-add9-95511b4bd8f6",
